[{"title":"题昌化令张侯瑞应册","author":"李之世","text":"大明天子坐明堂，山陬海澨遐哉荒。\n悲翠珠贝走上方，有邑淳简儋之昌。\n厥侯为政古循良，则壤惟赋均且详。\n鞭笞不事民乐将，桄榔树下课农桑。\n有雨随车濡瀼瀼，散之原野尽天浆。\n禾登于垄谷盈厢，民之乐只帝力忘。\n槟榔椰实树千章，更于其下牧牛羊。\n使君何必下琴堂，八风六律调宫商。\n雁鸿中泽鸣载翔，鸮食其葚音则臧。\n草不知风波不扬，三秀晔晔产芝房。\n金砂淘粒蚌舒光，丰碑洗出峻灵王。\n再拜稽首神固藏，公无渡河河汤汤。\n须臾汔济河断梁，民加其额公寿康，公曰偶尔未为祥。\n即今奏最上岩廊，天子曰嗟尔化昌，御屏定书昌化张。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":26891,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"解嘲和坡公夜梦","author":"李之世","text":"旁人笑我士不如，终日諵諵一卷书。\n龛灯常过午夜馀，是起刚及晓钟初。\n胡为局局不自舒，前身定是一蠹鱼。\n我言万族皆有缘，诗书于我真奇偏。\n带经而仕又三年，依然旧习相搆缠。\n较之博奕此为贤。\n匪余癖也古有然，大圣三绝易韦编。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":26892,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"因病閒居和闻子由瘦","author":"李之世","text":"近服黄连稍断肉，顿顿只啖黄粱粥。\n窗灯眼缬未成眠，入作蚊声逐蝙蝠。\n朝来投牒乞移疴，刚得闭门一避俗。\n氍毹半拥绛帐明，冷衾未许偎红玉。\n风敲短檐落叶乾，寒肌隐隐生金粟。\n强调中气守黄庭，心花瞀眩奔狂鹿。\n印锁空庭鸟雀哗，山厨黠鼠欺童仆。\n才梳短发帽宽欹，带孔移腰形似鹄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":26893,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"摘荔枝和谢欧阳晦夫","author":"李之世","text":"往来四海五经年，制得沈香黑角冠。\n土人笑指私相诧，赠我抺额青花缦。\n白藤细笠黄皮屐，我今暂与俗相安。\n从来入俗须从俗，且与扬波泛其澜。\n万安藤枕细且滑，定安草簟冰纹寒。\n携之花阴供午睡，要与家山一样看。\n海风啸林夏不热，荔枝五月遍冈峦。\n脱冠戴笠游其下，新衣黎葛轻如纨。\n三杯粘酒颓然醉，先生颜赛荔枝丹。\n倾筐倒来携满袖，饱啖还解带围宽。\n东坡韶腹佞其舌，作词翻笑海翁酸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":26894,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王际明以藤枕见贻拈韵答之和坡翁琴枕","author":"李之世","text":"七尺匡床置草屋，展开冰簟蕲州竹。\n副以万州细藤枕，一生閒具亦云足。\n朝来解带倦将迎，重衫脱下汗如漉。\n凭君相引入华胥，钧天一鼓双门曲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":26895,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄何凤来读书西山","author":"李之世","text":"是尔栖迟处，西山爽气增。\n孤亭悬树杪，小径入云层。\n谷鸟啼窗竹，岩花缀涧藤。\n冷光摇碧霭，岚彩冒疏灯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":26896,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过越王故苑","author":"李之世","text":"废苑郁迢迢，霸图尚未销。\n落花如有恨，片片度溪桥。\n鸟学歌声涩，云疑舞袖飘。\n谁将千古意，指点认前朝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":26897,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自省还洞中作","author":"李之世","text":"牢落倦游归，萧然掩旧扉。\n藓留题处墨，荷换去时衣。\n一雨秋阴淡，孤峰倒景微。\n晚来新水到，垂钓坐苔矶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":26898,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寒食感怀","author":"李之世","text":"由来寒食节，风雨倍悽然。\n人世犹如此，夜台殊可怜。\n垂杨烟漠漠，荒垄草芊芊。\n向晚乌啼急，双飞集墓田。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":26899,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"林阳仲携诸子月夜过访余走逆城南不值赋此寄之","author":"李之世","text":"共拟探幽去，如何踏雪来。\n不知萝月下，曾否荜门开。\n行迹馀芳草，留题觅古苔。\n冷然清兴尽，何异剡溪回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":26900,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"卧病","author":"李之世","text":"岁晚怜家居，翛然一鹤如。\n常时亲枕簟，经月罢琴书。\n文债犹催逼，閒缘未断除。\n应门频有报，花下驻朋车。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":26901,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"开径","author":"李之世","text":"开径遥分竹，疏流近接堤。\n雨含湘浦泪，春入武陵迷。\n细荇鱼吹浪，高枝鹊借凄。\n閒情应不减，风物每撩题。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":26902,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泊甘竹","author":"李之世","text":"稍觉乡关近，移舟泊海门。\n万山盘一壑，小经入孤村。\n岐路心俱折，还家舌尚存。\n不须吟泽畔，沙岸转黄昏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":26903,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"经古汶洲寄陈夷仲","author":"李之世","text":"此地昔为别，经过倍怆颜。\n人家平贴水，日影半衔山。\n一雁来何处，扁舟去独閒。\n殷勤江上鲤，寄信到松关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":26904,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"客至","author":"李之世","text":"闭门缘避客，客至偶开门。\n乍见不为礼，相看无一言。\n烹茶分曲涧，散帙媚幽轩。\n勿讶元龙傲，还令古谊存。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":26905,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苏汝载山房同韩孟郁杨亦琳刘觐国话别","author":"李之世","text":"暝色下庭阴，移觞傍竹林。\n别离不在远，去住总关心。\n久客乡园梦，怀人落日吟。\n共怜他夜月，尊酒不同斟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":26906,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泊黄村","author":"李之世","text":"云澹水涓涓，中天皎月悬。\n松梧依静渚，墟里上孤烟。\n宿桨轻鸥外，乡愁旅雁前。\n空江人语寂，对此未成眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":26907,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元旦祝圣","author":"李之世","text":"肃仗传呼急，严城鼓吹残。\n千年周镐洛，一代汉衣冠。\n淑气回金阙，光风转画阑。\n天南虽万里，日出是长安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":26908,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荐家庙","author":"李之世","text":"焚香扫敝室，稽首泪沾巾。\n虽有冰盘荐，何曾匕箸亲。\n萧条伤往事，惨淡对芳辰。\n旧种庭前橘，年年春色新。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":26909,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游圭峰二十首 其一 入峡望圭峰","author":"李之世","text":"群峰趋谷口，绾胜有危桥。\n望望玉台寺，钟声来碧霄。\n云迷天路迥，水接花源遥。\n况复高秋日，登临野思饶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":26910,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游圭峰二十首 其二 玉台寺","author":"李之世","text":"宝刹开灵境，慈云护法堂。\n僧閒不扫地，客到但焚香。\n塔影澄秋霁，松阴散晚凉。\n悠然息尘想，随意礼空王。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":26911,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游圭峰二十首 其三 玄帝殿","author":"李之世","text":"北极是天都。\n玄冥护赤符。\n风云开法阵，营卫肃辰枢。\n玉节时趋阙，商飙飒戒途。\n千年香火地，斜日锁金铺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":26912,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游圭峰二十首 其四 文昌宫","author":"李之世","text":"灵洞清虚府，天街白玉堂。\n山河扶绣栱，星斗焕宸章。\n独揽中峰色，还依帝座傍。\n碧桃千万树，偏浥露华香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":26913,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游圭峰二十首 其五 观音庵","author":"李之世","text":"来参大士座，妙相果庄严。\n千手金轮转，双眉珠火尖。\n白猿閒听法，青鸽静窥帘。\n一片华池月，流光满四檐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":26914,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游圭峰二十首 其六 李真人庙","author":"李之世","text":"空传坠履迹，犹想餐芝颜。\n古庙无人到，苍苔一径閒。\n云阴馀落日，秋露满空山。\n何事令威鹤，千年殊未还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":26915,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游圭峰二十首 其七 玄峰道士山房","author":"李之世","text":"群峰望不极，一室迥清虚。\n莫是化人国，真成静者居。\n岩花细绕径，涧水暗通渠。\n我亦云中侣，来参方外书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":26916,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游圭峰二十首 其八 听雨坛","author":"李之世","text":"扫地象圜丘，祈年事可求。\n翻云开羽节，和露荐琼羞。\n拥佩祠官集，飏幡真侣游。\n近闻四气洽，禋祀不曾脩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":26917,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游圭峰二十首 其九 真人岩","author":"李之世","text":"神室何年閟，灵踪久已芜。\n古松巢野鹤，阴雪餐饥鼯。\n石鼎三芝秀，云房五色铺。\n凭高望海气，一点类蓬壶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":26918,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游圭峰二十首 其十 石床","author":"李之世","text":"真人惟面壁，石榻仅容肱。\n雨没萦裾草，云垂交户藤。\n鸟王衔绛果，山鬼吹青灯。\n指点灵奇迹，高风信可凭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":26919,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游圭峰二十首 其十一 朝斗石","author":"李之世","text":"片石分云出，生成礼斗坛。\n星河七曜动，环佩五更寒。\n灵雨阴长润，霜华剥不刊。\n飞来双白鹄，缥缈下层峦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":26920,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游圭峰二十首 其十二 嘉树","author":"李之世","text":"嘉树蟠云固，亭亭万仞枝。\n罡风吹不动，湛露泫长垂。\n帝遣神工护，人钦佛力持。\n林端舍利影，光蘸碧琉璃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":26921,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游圭峰二十首 其十三 瀑泉","author":"李之世","text":"双泉悬碧落，百折度丹梯。\n迸作飞空雨，泻为漱玉溪。\n蒸云喷宿雾，插汉饮晴霓。\n可是巫山女，垂垂珠箔低。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":26922,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游圭峰二十首 其十四 借宿禅堂","author":"李之世","text":"借榻禅居净，冷然听梵音。\n灯明方丈室，香袭旃檀林。\n共觅无生路，因知不染心。\n月华偏法界，清夜对沈沈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":26923,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游圭峰二十首 其十五 石龛","author":"李之世","text":"石龛锁青壁，面面有灯燃。\n乍映摩尼色，偏临净乐天。\n飞空流玉镜，特地涌金莲。\n但悟无生灭，何须学四禅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":26924,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游圭峰二十首 其十六 寒甚从道人索衣","author":"李之世","text":"名山采药遍，薄暮怯霜寒。\n衣自霞缃出，人疑鹤氅看。\n凌风云气湿，被月露光漙。\n便可还初服，因之制竹冠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":26925,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游圭峰二十首 其十七 从东岭度逆折而西登绝顶","author":"李之世","text":"直蹑云根出，方知中岭尊。\n地临南极尽，山以北为藩。\n曰涌双轮转，枢旋万象奔。\n疑闻钧乐奏，咫尺是天门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":26926,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游圭峰二十首 其十八 从真人庵降就行厨入禅堂始饭","author":"李之世","text":"凌晨披雾出，归始及朝炊。\n香饭僧厨借，山薇野客遗。\n和云烹露茗，就石撷灵芝。\n顿觉颓颜变，飞仙挟可期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":26927,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游圭峰二十首 其十九 诗社","author":"李之世","text":"重来诗酒会，耆旧几人全。\n白社空留迹，青山不住年。\n荒台萦蔓棘，池草莽凄烟。\n寂寞千秋事，登坛一泫然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":26928,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游圭峰二十首 其二十","author":"李之世","text":"聊持一觞酒，来就飞泉阴。\n远公何处去，策杖还相寻。\n同是栖真侣，谁悬出世心。\n莞然成一笑，送送过东林。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":26929,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋水芙蓉","author":"李之世","text":"朱华涵绿浪，并泻一秋光。\n澹冶生閒韵，清妍濯浅凉。\n飘来枝影动，散去岸痕香。\n水镜如同照，流波望正长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":26930,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄嗣淳家兄","author":"李之世","text":"洛阳千古地，宰邑有吾兄。\n露冕行□过，壶浆遮道迎。\n云遄雍邱国，花重高阳城。\n翘首长安近，双凫切太清。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":26931,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"讯林阳仲落第","author":"李之世","text":"闻君不得意，归复掩柴关。\n世路原如此，浮名亦等閒。\n曲惭歌下里，书好副名山。\n若问行藏事，相看镜里颜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":26932,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登西山阁限韵","author":"李之世","text":"秋色来何处，空亭夕景衔。\n山情恬鸟雀，霜意宿松杉。\n寺近时闻钟，林疏忽辨帆。\n平芜踏歌遍，岚重湿衣衫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":26933,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访容植之山馆","author":"李之世","text":"山径少逢迎，幽居无俗情。\n密云过户湿，细雨入池平。\n插架琴书静，侵阶苜蓿荣。\n高谈二三子，终日有馀清。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":26934,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同余彩震宿东山草堂","author":"李之世","text":"城头月似霜，流影入松房。\n乍觉衣裳薄，全消枕簟凉。\n花阴閒命酌，石几静燃香。\n终夜无言说，迢迢清梦长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":26935,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望临江台寄陈瑜仲陈熙父","author":"李之世","text":"孤台临断岸，此地昔攀登。\n擘石沈危浪，盘空缀古藤。\n山童横牧笛，溪妇晒鱼罾。\n极目观溟涨，垂纶愧未能。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":26936,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠施纯卿","author":"李之世","text":"四十犹未遇，生涯殊可悲。\n世情看俯仰，吾道属支离。\n挟有干时略，贫无买酒赀。\n颓然堪一笑，何物是男儿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":26937,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽吴别驾","author":"李之世","text":"含砂终误毒，抱玉岂鸣冤。\n一死酬臣节，千秋作礼魂。\n棘林新鬼哭，白日帝城昏。\n不是能尸谏，何由感至尊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":26938,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄怀罗华麓丈人","author":"李之世","text":"养寂衡门下，居然丘壑尊。\n木奴千树橘，石室一家言。\n岁月乌皮几，风花绿玉樽。\n暌违今十载，幽意向谁论。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":26939,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夜访蒋伯瑞小酌","author":"李之世","text":"东游不得意，归兴日悠悠。\n夜雨芙蓉剑，秋风芦叶舟。\n寒虫偏入户，残月故当楼。\n况值黄花候，清尊好共留。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":26940,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初发湴湖与仲昭侄别","author":"李之世","text":"暂尔离乡井，暮行投远村。\n驿亭无长吏，稚子候柴门。\n平明驱马去，露白岸微昏。\n严程自兹始，羁思更何言。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":26941,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浈阳道中","author":"李之世","text":"危峰半入云，雨色霭氤氲。\n向晚浈阳道，愁穿豺虎群。\n路回青嶂断，石溜碧泉分。\n蒙涂兼历险，于役此何云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":26942,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"度清溪","author":"李之世","text":"攒峰如列戟，古木郁凄迷。\n尽日闻猿啸，长风送马蹄。\n人烟茆屋午，官路板桥西。\n异境何曾到，磨厓觅古题。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":26943,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望曹溪","author":"李之世","text":"招提不可到，樵径一僧逢。\n问询前山路，翠微知几重。\n林光浮舍利，水香藏钵龙。\n居然灵境隔，立马听遥钟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":26944,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜度曹溪","author":"李之世","text":"一灯传影后，兹水共留名。\n浩淼来何处，沿洄绕化城。\n宁因浴佛洁，始辨入山清。\n自笑迷津子，褰裳此夜行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":26945,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"途中杂咏 其一","author":"李之世","text":"京国数千里，悠悠去不停。\n鸡声破晓雾，马首认残星。\n古戍依寒草，官桥间短亭。\n无情堤畔柳，憔悴不成青。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":26946,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"途中杂咏 其二","author":"李之世","text":"野店临平坂，荒村人语稀。\n步檐惊虎迹，登榻卧牛衣。\n客至时争席，童嗔半苦饥。\n天涯一翘首，能使旅情微。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":26947,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"途中杂咏 其三","author":"李之世","text":"北地殊风候，兼之岁欲残。\n辟尘缯覆面，冲雪革为冠。\n苦水酴酥酒，腥羹苜蓿盘。\n罄囊持一饭，未结主人欢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":26948,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"途中杂咏 其四","author":"李之世","text":"肩舆不可度，霜滑磴途赊。\n倒影疑涵水，长天带落霞。\n行人驱蚁队，稚子挽牛车。\n同旅时相劳，前村日未斜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":26949,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"途中杂咏 其五","author":"李之世","text":"寒色暝凄凄，荒墟古木齐。\n饥乌时自出，瘦马不闻嘶。\n夹毂人相叱，畏途剑独携。\n由来贪访胜，到处漫留题。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":26950,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"逍遥台","author":"李之世","text":"下马临高台，迢迢但草莱。\n雀罗人事改，花发夕阳催。\n废井围荒棘，残碑没古苔。\n雍门昔有泪，千载思悠哉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":26951,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"安远除夕同韩孟郁甘存之守岁 其一","author":"李之世","text":"间关馀万里，迢递向京华。\n政尔逢除夕，萧然寄酒家。\n驿路临淮近，濉流绕郭斜。\n悠悠此行迈，离思满天涯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":26952,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"安远除夕同韩孟郁甘存之守岁 其二","author":"李之世","text":"收盘随俗供，尊酒话平生。\n湖海穷交泪，风尘羁旅情。\n红颜芳岁换，白眼世途轻。\n顾已牵缘役，劳劳何所营。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":26953,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登涿州城","author":"李之世","text":"危楼抗百雉，锁钥壮神州。\n表里连三辅，襟喉属上游。\n浮云边塞色，落日蓟门秋。\n极目寒烟外，金河百折流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":26954,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"京邸立春","author":"李之世","text":"瑞雪霭芳辰，轻烟袅袅新。\n青阳初应律，朱邸迥临春。\n就日披荣早，迎风解冻匀。\n自怜衰朽质，嘘咈藉洪钧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":26955,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"关门","author":"李之世","text":"关门壮国险，寒色迥沈沈。\n肃卫千屯合，崇墉百雉阴。\n黄尘飞古道，白日下幽岑。\n一片陇头月，清霜拂藁砧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":26956,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]